<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Email Verification</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f6f9fc;
      color: #333;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      background: #ffffff;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1a73e8;
    }
    .otp {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #1a73e8;
      background: #f1f5ff;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    p {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .footer {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #777;
      margin-top: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
   <h2>Verify your email address</h2> 
   <p>Hello {{name}},</p> 
   <p> Welcome to <strong>Relisted</strong> 👋 <br /> To complete your registration and start buying or listing items, please use the verification code below. </p>
    <div class="otp">{{code}}</div> <p class="note"> This code will expire in <strong>10 minutes</strong>. If you didn’t create a Relisted account, you can safely ignore this email. </p>
     <div class="footer"> © {{year}} Relisted. All rights reserved.<br /> Buy. Sell. Relist with confidence. </div>
</body>
</html>
